# Whitelist: only scripts and documents are tracked (per professor, 2026-09-21).
# Experiment outputs (logs, configs, csv/json/npz results, traces, QPC, ONNX, npy, bin) stay local.
*
!*/
!.gitignore
!*.md
!*.py
!*.sh
!*.cpp
!tools/moe_joint_runtime.h
!*.html
!9.17.2026/结论总结/*.txt
!9.17.2026/结论总结/*.png
# never these, even if a directory above is re-included
**/qpc/
**/qpc_*/
**/__pycache__/

# build_recipes/ holds the full rebuild recipe (json/yaml/log configs) for the deleted
# full-model QPCs; it is 720 KB and every file type in it is tracked on purpose.
!perop_moe/build_recipes/**

# GitHub pack for the final-combine write-up: its figures are tracked
!github_pack/figures/*.png
